{"seq":1,"slug":"testing-strategy","title":"测试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/testing-and-quality/testing-strategy","wordCount":763,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"测试策略\">测试策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Monorepo 测试用<strong>测试金字塔</strong>分层，并让每一层落在仓库中的正确位置：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>验证对象</th>\n<th>在 Monorepo 中的位置</th>\n<th>数量/速度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>包内逻辑</td>\n<td>每个包内部</td>\n<td>大量 · 快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td>包间交互</td>\n<td>使用真实内部依赖的包</td>\n<td>适量 · 中速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2E 测试</td>\n<td>完整用户流程</td>\n<td><code>apps/</code> 应用层</td>\n<td>少量 · 慢</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Monorepo 给测试带来一个独特优势：<strong>集成测试可以直接使用内部包的真实实现，无需 mock</strong>，从而捕获包间接口不匹配的问题。执行策略沿维度划分——本地 watch 单包、PR 只跑受影响包（affected-only）、合并到 main 全量运行；由于各包独立运行测试产生独立报告，覆盖率还需要聚合为全局视图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-测试的分层模型\">Monorepo 测试的分层模型</h2><p>在 Monorepo 中，测试不仅要覆盖单个包的功能正确性，还要验证包之间的集成是否正常。<strong>测试金字塔</strong>（Test Pyramid）在 Monorepo 场景下有了新的含义：单元测试聚焦于包内逻辑，集成测试聚焦于包间交互，端到端测试则验证完整应用的用户流程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 测试金字塔&#10;        E2E[&quot;🔺 E2E 测试&lt;br/&gt;少量 · 慢 · 高信心&quot;]&#10;        INTEGRATION[&quot;🔶 集成测试&lt;br/&gt;适量 · 中速 · 中信心&quot;]&#10;        UNIT[&quot;🟩 单元测试&lt;br/&gt;大量 · 快 · 低信心&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph Monorepo 映射&#10;        E2E_M[&quot;apps/web 的 E2E&lt;br/&gt;Playwright / Cypress&quot;]&#10;        INT_M[&quot;packages/ui 使用 utils 的集成&lt;br/&gt;测试真实依赖&quot;]&#10;        UNIT_M[&quot;每个包内部的单元测试&lt;br/&gt;Vitest&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    E2E --- E2E_M&#10;    INTEGRATION --- INT_M&#10;    UNIT --- UNIT_M\">graph TB\n    subgraph 测试金字塔\n        E2E[\"🔺 E2E 测试&lt;br/&gt;少量 · 慢 · 高信心\"]\n        INTEGRATION[\"🔶 集成测试&lt;br/&gt;适量 · 中速 · 中信心\"]\n        UNIT[\"🟩 单元测试&lt;br/&gt;大量 · 快 · 低信心\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Monorepo 映射\n        E2E_M[\"apps/web 的 E2E&lt;br/&gt;Playwright / Cypress\"]\n        INT_M[\"packages/ui 使用 utils 的集成&lt;br/&gt;测试真实依赖\"]\n        UNIT_M[\"每个包内部的单元测试&lt;br/&gt;Vitest\"]\n    end\n\n    E2E --- E2E_M\n    INTEGRATION --- INT_M\n    UNIT --- UNIT_M</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"单元测试-包内逻辑验证\">单元测试：包内逻辑验证</h2><p>每个包应该有独立的单元测试，覆盖其公开 API 的行为。在 Monorepo 中，推荐使用 <strong>Vitest</strong> 作为测试框架，因为它与 Vite 生态集成良好，支持 TypeScript 和 ESM：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// packages/utils/src/format.test.ts&#10;import { describe, it, expect } from &#39;vitest&#39;;&#10;import { formatCurrency, formatDate, clamp } from &#39;./format&#39;;&#10;&#10;describe(&#39;formatCurrency&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  it(&#39;should format CNY correctly&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    expect(formatCurrency(1234.56, &#39;CNY&#39;)).toBe(&#39;¥1,234.56&#39;);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  it(&#39;should handle zero&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    expect(formatCurrency(0, &#39;USD&#39;)).toBe(&#39;$0.00&#39;);&#10;  });&#10;});&#10;&#10;describe(&#39;clamp&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  it(&#39;should clamp value within range&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    expect(clamp(150, 0, 100)).toBe(100);&#10;    expect(clamp(-10, 0, 100)).toBe(0);&#10;    expect(clamp(50, 0, 100)).toBe(50);&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// packages/utils/src/format.test.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { describe, it, expect } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vitest'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { formatCurrency, formatDate, clamp } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './format'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'formatCurrency'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'should format CNY correctly'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">formatCurrency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1234.56</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CNY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'¥1,234.56'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'should handle zero'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">formatCurrency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'USD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$0.00'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'clamp'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'should clamp value within range'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">clamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">150</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">clamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">clamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"共享测试配置\">共享测试配置</h3><p>在根目录定义共享的 Vitest 配置，各包通过继承扩展：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// vitest.workspace.ts&#10;import { defineWorkspace } from &#39;vitest/config&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineWorkspace([&#39;packages/*/vitest.config.ts&#39;, &#39;apps/*/vitest.config.ts&#39;]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// vitest.workspace.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineWorkspace } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vitest/config'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineWorkspace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'packages/*/vitest.config.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'apps/*/vitest.config.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// packages/utils/vitest.config.ts&#10;import { defineConfig } from &#39;vitest/config&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  test: {&#10;    globals: true,&#10;    environment: &#39;node&#39;,&#10;    include: [&#39;src/**/*.test.ts&#39;],&#10;    coverage: {&#10;      provider: &#39;v8&#39;,&#10;      reporter: [&#39;text&#39;, &#39;json&#39;, &#39;html&#39;],&#10;      thresholds: {&#10;        branches: 80,&#10;        functions: 80,&#10;        lines: 80,&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// packages/utils/vitest.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineConfig } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vitest/config'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  test: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    globals: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    environment: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'node'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    include: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/**/*.test.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    coverage: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      provider: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'v8'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      reporter: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'text'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'html'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shik